# Optional settings for refresh.sh
#
# To get a free push notification (via ntfy.sh, no signup needed) whenever
# a refresh fails or rolls back, set NOTIFY_TOPIC below to something unique
# and hard to guess (topics on ntfy.sh are not private otherwise), then:
#   1. Install the ntfy app (Android/iOS) and subscribe to that same topic
#      name, OR just open https://ntfy.sh/your-topic-name in a browser tab.
#   2. That's it - no account, no API key needed.
#
# Leave blank / delete this file entirely to disable notifications - the
# script still works fine and just logs to ~/refresh.log instead.

NOTIFY_TOPIC=
